### Metering prices (platform-injected — `platform-metering.mdc`)

Space owner pays **2× wholesale** from personal wallet. Do not commit these — update on build server when provider rates change.

| Variable | Default (USD) | Purpose |
|----------|---------------|---------|
| `CREDITS_CHARGE_MULTIPLIER` | `2` | User credits = wholesale_usd × 100 × multiplier (2× wholesale) |
| `DEEPINFRA_CHAT_INPUT_PRICE_PER_M` | `0.15` | DeepInfra fast chat input / 1M — `openai/gpt-oss-120b-Turbo` |
| `DEEPINFRA_CHAT_OUTPUT_PRICE_PER_M` | `0.60` | DeepInfra fast chat output / 1M |
| `DEEPINFRA_INFERENCE_INPUT_PRICE_PER_M` | `0.08` | DeepInfra chat input / 1M — must match `DEEPINFRA_INFERENCE_MODEL` (`Qwen/Qwen3-32B`) |
| `DEEPINFRA_INFERENCE_OUTPUT_PRICE_PER_M` | `0.28` | DeepInfra chat output / 1M — `Qwen/Qwen3-32B` |
| `DEEPINFRA_EMBEDDING_PRICE_PER_M` | `0.01` | Embeddings / 1M — `Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B` |
| `DEEPINFRA_RERANKER_PRICE_PER_M` | `0.01` | Rerank / 1M — `Qwen/Qwen3-Reranker-0.6B` |

**ZAPI speech/TTS** (server1 `/opt/zeresoft/.env` — not app build inject): `AI_SPEECH_MODEL`, `AI_SPEECH_USD_PER_MINUTE`, `AI_TTS_MODEL`, `AI_TTS_USD_PER_MILLION_CHARS` — see `platform-metering.mdc`.

**Not metered:** MapTiler — platform absorbs tile cost until self-hosted tiling exists.

