## Code — read ZAPI URL (`VTC_API_URL`)

**New apps:** `VTC_API_URL` only. **Migrating apps:** accept legacy name until updated.

```typescript
// src/lib/env.ts — canonical helper (add to new apps)
export function getVtcApiUrl(): string {
  const url = process.env.VTC_API_URL ?? process.env.POSIF_API_URL
  if (!url) throw new Error('Missing VTC_API_URL')
  return url.replace(/\/$/, '')
}
```

```typescript
// Static Vite — browser
const apiBase = import.meta.env.VITE_VTC_API_URL ?? import.meta.env.VITE_POSIF_API_URL
if (!apiBase) throw new Error('Missing VITE_VTC_API_URL')
```

`@vtc/sdk`: `apiBaseUrl: getVtcApiUrl()` — install from `https://npm.vtc.com` (`vtc-packages.mdc`).

