## Commit in `.env.production` (app-owned)

| Variable | When |
|----------|------|
| `NODE_ENV=production` | Always |
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_ACCENT` | Optional app default accent (`ui.mdc` — URL `color` wins in shell) |
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_DISPLAY_NAME` | App title in shell / landing |
| `APP_DEPLOYMENT_TYPE=dedicated` | Only true publisher-DB apps (`app-types.mdc`) |
| Stripe / payment keys | App-specific |
| App-to-app URLs | e.g. `WALLET_APP_URL` — env only, never hardcode |
| Other app secrets | Custom APIs, webhooks |

**Do not commit** (injected or overwritten): `VTC_API_URL`, `POSIF_API_URL`, `VITE_*` API/storage/map mirrors, `MAPTILER_*`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPTILER_*`, `VITE_MAPTILER_*`, `AI_DEFAULT_*`, `MONGODB_URI`, all `DEEPINFRA_*`, storage/map platform vars, realtime/chat/shell vars, `APP_NAME`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_VTC_URL`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_POSIF_URL`.

Do **not** commit `HETZNER_*` / internal MinIO credentials — production uses `@vtc/sdk/storage` + ZAPI (`storage.mdc`).

