## Static Vite SPA (`runtime_type=static`)

Build injects `VITE_VTC_API_URL` and `VITE_POSIF_API_URL` (same value). **Do not commit** either once deploy pipeline is current.

| Variable | Commit? |
|----------|---------|
| `VITE_VTC_API_URL` / `VITE_POSIF_API_URL` | **No** — build mirrors from `VTC_API_URL` |
| `VITE_STORAGE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL` | **No** — build mirrors storage CDN |
| `VITE_MAP_STYLE_URL` | **No** — build mirrors platform map style |
| `VITE_MAPTILER_API_KEY` / `VITE_MAPTILER_STYLE_URL` | **No** — build mirrors MapTiler key + style template |

Read in code: `import.meta.env.VITE_VTC_API_URL` — `runtime-types.mdc`, `scaffold-checklist-static.mdc`.

