## Platform API (ZAPI)

- Never hardcode `api.vtc.com` — use `getVtcApiUrl()` / `VTC_API_URL`
- Browser (Next.js): same-origin `/api/*` only
- Shared prod DB: `GET ${getVtcApiUrl()}/api/v1/db/` + Bearer JWT

## Missing vars

```typescript
function requireEnv(name: string): string {
  const value = process.env[name]
  if (!value) throw new Error(`Missing required env: ${name}`)
  return value
}
```
